{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">將軍澳有鹹水管滲漏，將軍澳、調景嶺及將軍澳工業邨一帶，沖廁水供應受影響。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">涉及的鹹水管直徑900毫米，位於康城路北側。昨晚開始出現滲漏，水務署早上派員到場搶修。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.WATER.FOLO-1130_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026z1V9FsuhVT1788062236.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.WATER.FOLO-1130_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">這條水管是供應沖廁水予百勝角路、日出康城、石角路及將軍澳工業邨一帶，水務署預計晚上10時恢復供水。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T04:18:16.634634+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}